      "cooked": "<p>Wager Master vs. Completionist Guise, Bunker, Wraith, Legay, and Fanatic in Omnitron-IV.</p>\n<p>Pretty high-damage opener, but I didn't have any trouble. Everyone finished in the teens except Legacy at 21. Flipped WM&nbsp;round 1, he was dead by the end of round 2. Focusing on damage in basically all respects, along with my two choices of swaps with Completionist Guise (one to swap out Bunker, one to swap out Fanatic) both turning out very useful, made it a breeze.</p>",
